        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">In a senior center cooking class, a Black veteran and a Vietnamese refugee confront fifty years of bitterness through the chemistry of pho, simmering down a divide etched by war.</Text>
